Being the only survivor of the King’s Daughters on the journey from France to New France, Marie-Marie found herself being courted by three young men for her hand in marriage.

There is Joseph, a goofy and cheerful lumberjack/farmer; 

François, a wealthy village merchant with a mysterious aura; 

And Pierre-Esprit, a fur hunter with a tough exterior, yet a soft interior.

Who would be the one succeed in stealing Marie-Marie's heart?

